      "message": "[warning] Line 568: 🟡 `getNativeCallMediaState()` can report `WAITING` for calls that are already disconnected when their `CallState` is still `INACTIVE` (the current `DISCONNECTED` check is gated behind `ACTIVE`). This can make clients keep polling/retrying on ended calls. Treat `ConnectionState::DISCONNECTED` as `UNAVAILABLE` regardless of `CallState` to keep the API contract (`UNAVAILABLE` for ended calls) consistent.",
